OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer and group build natural
OL,4,Aflood defences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer and village group have built
OL,7,Ftheir own flood defences following a
OL,8,F#250,000 government grant.
OL,10,FBrampton 2 Zero Community Interest
OL,11,FCompany worked with Alan Bowman, who
OL,12,Fhas farmed his land for 33 years, to
OL,13,Finstall earth barriers and restore a
OL,14,Fnatural bog at Brampton Beck and
OL,15,FBrampton Fell Moss.
OL,17,FPhil Furneaux, who led the group's
OL,18,Fscheme, said Brampton faced an
OL,19,Fincreased flood risk from the beck
OL,20,Fwhich flows under the town centre and
OL,21,Fhe "feels confident that future deluges
OL,22,Fwill be held back".
